        "multilangContent": {
          "en": {
            "id": 1,
            "content": "{\"story\":\"<p>With the criterion of bringing delicious hot pot from raw materials, complete health and beauty from the inside, Asanoha is a modern Japanese hot pot model that helps to enhance health, support resistance, healthy people, beautiful skin and keep in shape.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The secret lies in the hot pot and premium mushrooms, using the Mizutaki method of refining 8 special broths and the source of fresh mushrooms grown at Asanoha's Sachi Farm</p>\"}"
          }
